    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d219-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d219-f1-content">
                <p>This report is attached to a covering note of June 14 from MacArthur to the
                    Secretary. In that note the Counselor recommended that Dulles read several
                    sections “to get the main substance of the report”. (790.5/6–1454) All sections
                    recommended by MacArthur are included in the extracts printed here.</p>
            </note>
